{"id":"5b297c57a51d3204","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-fin-complexity.md","title":"Fin 的 Sigma2 完全性","display":"thm-fin-complexity — Fin 的 Sigma2 完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-fin-complexity","aliases":["20-thm-fin-complexity"],"display":"thm-fin-complexity — Fin 的 Sigma2 完全性","chapter":"4","section":"4.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 4.3.2","source_pdf_pages":[122],"source_printed_pages":[86],"depends_on":["[[20-df-fin]]","[[20-thm-inf-complexity]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-sigma-complete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-fin-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-fin-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fin-complexity — Fin 的 Sigma2 完全性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.3.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>122</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>86</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"551febe7ebb4dbc6\" href=\"?note=551febe7ebb4dbc6\" title=\"20-df-fin\">20-df-fin</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14c630355ef04ac5\" href=\"?note=14c630355ef04ac5\" title=\"20-thm-inf-complexity\">20-thm-inf-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fin}=\\omega\\setminus\\mathrm{Inf}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fin}=\\omega\\setminus\\mathrm{Inf}\\)</span>，使用同一标准域枚举。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"551febe7ebb4dbc6\" href=\"?note=551febe7ebb4dbc6\" title=\"20-df-fin\">20-df-fin</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"14c630355ef04ac5\" href=\"?note=14c630355ef04ac5\" title=\"20-thm-inf-complexity\">20-thm-inf-complexity</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fin-complexity}\\vdash\ne\\in\\mathrm{Fin}\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\ \\forall t\\ge s\\ [W_{e,t}=W_{e,s}],\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Fin},\\Sigma^0_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fin-complexity}\\vdash\ne\\in\\mathrm{Fin}\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\ \\forall t\\ge s\\ [W_{e,t}=W_{e,s}],\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Fin},\\Sigma^0_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限 c.e. 集的所有成员总在某阶段出现，此后阶段集不变；反向稳定的有限阶段集就是最终集合，所以显示式给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2\">\\(\\Sigma_2\\)</span> 上界。给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\Sigma_2\">\\(P\\in\\Sigma_2\\)</span>，其补集在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2\">\\(\\Pi_2\\)</span>，Inf 完备性给单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin P\\iff f(x)\\in\\mathrm{Inf}\">\\(x\\notin P\\iff f(x)\\in\\mathrm{Inf}\\)</span>。两边取补得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in P\\iff f(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fin}\">\\(x\\in P\\iff f(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fin}\\)</span>，同一函数仍单射。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.3.2；印刷 86 / PDF 122。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-fin","status":"resolved","id":"551febe7ebb4dbc6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-fin]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-inf-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"14c630355ef04ac5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-inf-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-sigma-complete","status":"resolved","id":"422e06e55bbb8b2f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-fin","status":"resolved","id":"551febe7ebb4dbc6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-fin]]；see [[20-thm-inf-complexity]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-inf-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"14c630355ef04ac5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-fin]]；see [[20-thm-inf-complexity]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-7","targe